I am standing in front of the door.
Frau Krüger is standing next to me.
I turn the key.
I open the door.
We are standing in the flat.
The ceilings are very high.
The windows are large.
A tree is standing in the courtyard.
The courtyard is very quiet.
Frau Krüger smiles.
"Good luck with the move, Frau Flores," she says.
"Thank you very much for your help, Frau Krüger," I say.
She goes back to her flat.
I close the door.
I am alone in the flat now.
My suitcase is standing next to the door.
My bag is lying on the suitcase.
I am finally home.
